tml", "Consent.dc.html", "Review.dc.html", "Question.dc.html", "Rejected.dc.html", "Amount.dc.html", "RepaymentDate.dc.html", "Digilocker.dc.html", "References.dc.html", "Summary.dc.html", "KfsView.dc.html", "SelfieIntro.dc.html", "Selfie.dc.html", "Address.dc.html", "Agreement.dc.html", "SignDraw.dc.html", "Sanctioned.dc.html", "Payout.dc.html", "EdgeBank.dc.html", "Autopay.dc.html", "Status.dc.html", "Home.dc.html", "HomeOverdue.dc.html", "HomeProgress.dc.html", "HomeOffer.dc.html", "LoanDetails.dc.html", "Repay.dc.html", "PaymentSent.dc.html", "Loans.dc.html", "Transactions.dc.html", "Reloan.dc.html", "Notifications.dc.html", "Rollover.dc.html", "EmiOffer.dc.html", "Closure.dc.html", "ExtensionPay.dc.html", "ExtensionDone.dc.html", "HomeExtended.dc.html", "Profile.dc.html", "Settings.dc.html", "Support.dc.html", "Trust.dc.html", "Complaint.dc.html", "LoanAccount.dc.html", "Devices.dc.html", "DeleteAccount.dc.html", "BackConfirm.dc.html", "StepReview.dc.html", "Offline.dc.html", "ServerError.dc.html", "SessionExpired.dc.html", "Resume.dc.html", "OtpLocked.dc.html", "UploadError.dc.html", "CameraDenied.dc.html", "EdgeKyc.dc.html", "NotEligible.dc.html", "PaymentRejected.dc.html", "Paused.dc.html", "ApplySubmitted.dc.html", "WebCallback.dc.html", "Download.dc.html", "Specs.dc.html", "Components.dc.html", "FirstTime.dc.html", "MilestoneMotion.dc.html", "StaffCollections.dc.html", "StaffExtensionOffer.dc.html", "StaffExtensionApprove.dc.html", "StaffLoanExtensions.dc.html"], "notes": {"t0": {"x": 0, "y": -280, "text": "0. App start and sign-in", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2872}, "tA": {"x": 0, "y": 1020, "text": "1. Sign up: 12 steps, same order as the code", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 7792}, "tB": {"x": 0, "y": 2580, "text": "2. Loan offer: 11 steps after credit approval", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 7792}, "tC": {"x": 0, "y": 4520, "text": "3. Dashboard, repay and loans", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 8276}, "tD": {"x": 0, "y": 6720, "text": "4. Account", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 4400}, "tE": {"x": 0, "y": 8920, "text": "5. Edge cases: nobody gets stuck", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 8712}, "tF": {"x": 0, "y": 10220, "text": "6. Specs, UI kit (app_navix), walkthrough and motion", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 6880}, "n0": {"x": 2952, "y": 0, "w": 380, "fill": "gray", "text": "App start: Splash checks app version, internet and session. First launch shows Intro once. Signed in: fingerprint (if on), then the server journey decides Resume or Dashboard.\nBorrower journey only. No staff screens."}, "nA": {"x": 7872, "y": 1300, "w": 380, "fill": "orange", "text": "Every screen title shows its web route. Step numbers and labels come from ONBOARDING_STEPS (12).\nResume is server-side: the app opens at whatever step GET journey returns (E6).\nApplications paused: Start sends the user to Log in; E13 is the details form.\nLocation: read automatically on Confirm & submit at A11 and sent to the existing address check; B7 only appears if that fails."}, "nB": {"x": 7872, "y": 2860, "w": 380, "fill": "orange", "text": "Order and labels from OFFER_STEPS (11). Count is server-driven: re-apply skips DigiLocker, references, selfie and address; Auto-repayment only when the digio-mandate flag is on.\nDigiLocker, Aadhaar e-sign and the Digio mandate open in a secure in-app browser tab and return via app link (replaces the web callback pages).\nAmounts follow the DhanNow 14-day product (₹1,000 Level 1, ₹742 in bank, ₹1,000 on day 14). The backend needs the changes in the difference document to support it."}, "nC": {"x": 8364, "y": 4800, "w": 380, "fill": "orange", "text": "Repay is manual, as in the backend: UPI QR or bank transfer, then reference + screenshot. Payment is Pending verification until the accounts team verifies it.\nBottom nav (app addition): Dashboard, Repay, Loans, Profile.\nPhone push needs a device-token endpoint the backend doesn’t have; in-app notifications exist."}, "nD": {"x": 3936, "y": 7000, "w": 380, "fill": "gray", "text": "Profile is view-only: details come from verified documents and can’t be changed, in the app or through support.\nD6 shows the loan account, lender, credit level and documents. D7 lists signed-in devices. D8 is the account deletion request Google Play requires.\nSupport and grievance use the DhanNow contacts from the KFS policy."}, "nE": {"x": 7872, "y": 9200, "w": 380, "fill": "orange", "text": "Rules that keep users unstuck:\n1. Every API-calling step: back opens E1 (Flutter PopScope).\n2. Finished steps reopen view-only (E2), so going back never re-submits.\n3. The main button locks with a spinner while a request runs.\n4. Every error has a retry and a way out (Dashboard or Support).\n5. The app always resumes at the server’s current step (E6).\n6. Support works logged out."}, "nL": {"x": 8332, "y": 9200, "w": 380, "fill": "red", "text": "Never re-run on back (each spends a provider call or a limit). Show Verified, no Edit:\nMobile OTP: 5 codes per 15 min\nConsent: OTP + bureau pull\nDigiLocker: 3 tries, 5 sessions per 24 h\nSelfie: 3 attempts\nPenny-drop: 3 failures, then 12 h lock\nMandate: attempt cap\nAadhaar e-sign: one per sanction"}, "tG": {"x": 0, "y": 11820, "text": "7. Loan extension (collections-led, staff console)", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 5920}, "nG": {"x": 6080, "y": 12100, "w": 420, "fill": "orange", "text": "Extension = 14 more days for fee + GST + 14 days' interest (₹258 per ₹1,000) plus late charge so far.\nOnly from a collections call; no extend button for borrowers.\nFlow: officer offers (G2) → Collection Head approves (G3) → borrower confirms with OTP in the app (C12) → pays in the app (C12b) or officer logs the payment → Accountant verifies (G3) → due date = old due + 14, income booked, borrower notified (C12c, C1b).\nCap 3 per loan (config); Admin override with reason. Extended loans don't raise the credit level."}}, "designSystems": []}